  "steps": [
    "Wash the dal and pressure-cook it with tomatoes, onion, green chilli, turmeric and 3 cups of water for 4 whistles.",
    "Mash everything well and stir in the salt; add hot water to reach a thick but flowing consistency.",
    "Heat the oil in a small pan and add the mustard seeds and cumin seeds.",
    "Add dried red chilli, crushed garlic, hing and curry leaves and fry until the garlic is golden brown.",
    "Pour the tempering over the pappu, mix, and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Garnish with coriander leaves and serve with rice and ghee."
  ]
